WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:04.581
My friends called the police, they
questioned me.

00:00:04.781 --> 00:00:06.102
Everyone stopped me.

00:00:06.362 --> 00:00:07.542
Everyone cut off my contact.

00:00:09.423 --> 00:00:13.124
Dursultan lives in a small, dark flat on
the outskirts of Istanbul.

00:00:13.624 --> 00:00:15.584
She arrived in Turkey 12 years ago.

00:00:17.245 --> 00:00:21.926
Bilka, come here.

00:00:21.927 --> 00:00:25.987
Initially, she came to work and earn a
living to escape poverty in Turkmenistan.

00:00:26.688 --> 00:00:27.568
But time passed.

00:00:28.076 --> 00:00:34.900
Today, she can no longer return to her
country.

00:00:40.163 --> 00:00:46.766
Dursultan began by publishing videos
against the

00:00:46.806 --> 00:00:47.767
Turkmen regime.

00:00:53.770 --> 00:00:57.092
She then took part in demonstrations in
the streets of Istanbul.

00:00:59.204 --> 00:01:02.545
We don't want dictatorship

00:01:05.746 --> 00:01:07.627
That's when she started to be targeted.

00:01:08.187 --> 00:01:12.008
Like the day she was in the middle of a
video conference meeting with other

00:01:12.008 --> 00:01:14.008
opponents.

00:01:14.008 --> 00:01:19.250
What do you want?

00:01:19.430 --> 00:01:23.291
They took my identity card.

00:01:23.292 --> 00:01:24.131
They took my money.

00:01:24.132 --> 00:01:25.712
If I take my old ID card, they will ask
for it.

00:01:30.507 --> 00:01:36.032
The people who are afraid of you are the
ones who are afraid of you.

00:01:36.072 --> 00:01:38.194
They are the ones who are afraid of you.

00:01:38.234 --> 00:01:39.515
They are the ones who are afraid of you.

00:01:39.516 --> 00:01:40.496
I think they shot the capital.

00:01:42.898 --> 00:01:45.521
The cities are empty.

00:01:45.641 --> 00:01:48.623
They are without people, without spirits.

00:02:06.978 --> 00:02:08.878
to say these things in Turkmenistan.

00:02:09.579 --> 00:02:16.460
Major NGOs such as Amnesty International
and Human Rights Watch ranked Turkmenistan

00:02:16.460 --> 00:02:18.460
among the most repressive states in the

00:02:18.460 --> 00:02:20.460
world.

00:02:26.682 --> 00:02:32.543
It's impossible

00:02:32.544 --> 00:02:35.964
to know the exact number of political
prisoners in Turkmen jails.

00:02:36.524 --> 00:02:41.002
However, she regularly receives examples
of abuses committed against opponents.

